<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on the Bangkok SET50 index.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on the Bangkok SET50 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued 50 million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on the Bangkok SET50 index, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls 10 of the underlying.</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   30.SEP.97		 PAYDATE	07.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   LONDON		    MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  84.5 THB</p>
<p> WARRANTS     STRIKE	 ISS PRICE     PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	 84.00 THB    $5.50	   15.95 PCT    6.05 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL B	 93.00 THB    $3.95	   21.94 PCT    8.42 TIMES</p>
<p> NOTES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
